# Assignment 5 – Google Dorking

## Description

Google Dorking is an advanced search technique that uses special search operators to locate publicly available information indexed by search engines. During this exercise, only **passive reconnaissance** techniques were used on publicly accessible data.

> **Note:** This activity was performed only for educational purposes using publicly available information. No unauthorized access or exploitation was attempted.

---

## Sample Google Dorks Practiced

```
site:gov.in

site:nic.in

site:ac.in

site:gov.in filetype:pdf

site:gov.in filetype:xlsx

site:gov.in intitle:index.of

site:gov.in "login"

site:gov.in "admin"

site:gov.in ext:sql

site:gov.in ext:log
```

